1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,856
StudyFlow helps students compare the cost of studying abroad, then plan how to

2
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:07,658
cover a funding gap.

3
00:00:07,658 --> 00:00:12,162
This demonstration uses live AI guidance and simulated financial transactions.

4
00:00:12,767 --> 00:00:16,100
We start in the English student workspace.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,434
The main action is a price question.

6
00:00:19,434 --> 00:00:23,244
Students can compare schools before providing financial information.

7
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:28,602
We ask the live model to compare four universities in Thailand.

8
00:00:28,602 --> 00:00:33,767
It returns whole-course estimates in Thai baht, with each course duration visible.

9
00:00:33,767 --> 00:00:38,072
PSU Phuket is the lowest current estimate in this comparison.

10
00:00:38,072 --> 00:00:43,238
These are sourced sample estimates, which students must check with the university.

11
00:00:43,867 --> 00:00:49,841
Next, we choose PSU Phuket and declare ten thousand baht in available study

12
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:50,301
funds.

13
00:00:50,301 --> 00:00:54,897
The assistant saves this information and opens the funding options.

14
00:00:54,897 --> 00:00:59,953
The full-course estimate is one million, thirteen thousand, eight hundred baht.

15
00:00:59,953 --> 00:01:05,468
The resulting funding gap is one million, three thousand, eight hundred baht.

16
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:10,187
We ask how much can be borrowed, without submitting an application.

17
00:01:10,187 --> 00:01:13,159
The live answer uses the server's pre-check result.

18
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:16,874
This is a simulated ceiling based on the funding gap.

19
00:01:16,874 --> 00:01:21,703
It is not a bank offer or an assessment of the family's ability

20
00:01:21,703 --> 00:01:22,446
to repay.

21
00:01:23,067 --> 00:01:28,685
We also ask the assistant to skip confirmation and transfer money before enrollment.

22
00:01:28,685 --> 00:01:32,142
In this recorded response, it defers the transfer.

23
00:01:32,142 --> 00:01:36,464
No money tool executes and the plan remains a draft.

24
00:01:37,067 --> 00:01:42,222
The student chooses a twenty thousand baht commercial study loan example, at four

25
00:01:42,222 --> 00:01:44,602
point five percent over sixty months.

26
00:01:44,602 --> 00:01:49,757
The server calculates the schedule and a monthly installment of three hundred seventy-two

27
00:01:49,757 --> 00:01:51,344
baht and eighty-six satang.

28
00:01:51,344 --> 00:01:54,913
This loan covers only part of the funding gap.

29
00:01:55,533 --> 00:02:01,319
The student reviews the confirmation dialog and explicitly confirms the plan and application.

30
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:03,545
The simulated application is approved.

31
00:02:03,545 --> 00:02:07,995
The assistant has not submitted it on the student's behalf.

32
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:13,477
Before signing, the student completes the displayed document checklist.

33
00:02:13,477 --> 00:02:15,644
These are demo declarations.

34
00:02:15,644 --> 00:02:22,147
They do not represent verification of uploaded identity, admission, or financial documents.

35
00:02:22,767 --> 00:02:25,004
Signing requires another explicit confirmation.

36
00:02:25,004 --> 00:02:30,820
The resulting loan schedules tuition payments to the school, rather than crediting the

37
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:33,504
borrowed amount to the student's wallet.

38
00:02:34,133 --> 00:02:39,022
The signed state shows the school's payout schedule and the next repayment.

39
00:02:39,022 --> 00:02:44,317
For the repayment demonstration, we advance the isolated demo clock and add a

40
00:02:44,317 --> 00:02:47,169
separate ten thousand baht synthetic wallet top-up.

41
00:02:47,169 --> 00:02:50,020
No real funds are received or transferred.

42
00:02:50,633 --> 00:02:54,468
The student reviews the first installment and confirms repayment.

43
00:02:54,468 --> 00:02:59,582
A password check is required before the server executes this simulated payment.

44
00:02:59,582 --> 00:03:04,695
The live model does not type the password or authorize the transaction.

45
00:03:06,633 --> 00:03:09,678
The first installment is now marked paid.

46
00:03:09,678 --> 00:03:15,331
The recording is backed by browser assertions and saved model-call traces, linking the

47
00:03:15,331 --> 00:03:18,376
live conversation to the actual application state.

48
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:24,454
StudyFlow connects cost comparison, funding guidance, and a confirmed loan journey.

49
00:03:24,454 --> 00:03:26,932
Live AI explains the options.

50
00:03:26,932 --> 00:03:32,882
The server calculates the amounts, and the student confirms the financial actions.
